An *embedded system* is a computer built into a larger device to do one dedicated job, usually running on a microcontroller such as #wlink("stm32")[STM32] and programmed in #wlink("c-language")[C].

This is the main field #wlink("user-jinju")[Jinju] works in.

= Topics
- Microcontrollers: #wlink("stm32")[STM32]
- Communication: #wlink("uart")[UART], #wlink("i2c")[I²C], #wlink("spi")[SPI]
- Real-time operating systems: #wlink("rtos")[RTOS]

